{"sourceUrl":"https://cps.suda.edu.cn/df/01/c11521a712449/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:51.134245+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://cps.suda.edu.cn/df/01/c11521a712449/page.htm","html":"<div><p><span>根据</span><span>上级</span><span>文件</span><span>要求</span><span>，结合学院具体情况，</span><span>特制定</span><span>本</span><span>细则</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>一</span><span>、</span><span>接收</span><span>专业</span></p><p><span><span>我</span></span><span><span>院</span></span><span><span>全日制硕士研究生招生专业均可接收推免生</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>具体专业</span></span><span><span>请登录</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>苏州大学研究生报考服务系统</span><span>”查阅</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span>二</span><span>、</span><span>报名</span><span>程序</span></p><p><span>1</span><span>．</span><span>推免生登录</span><span>“</span><span>苏州大学</span><span><span>研究生报考服务系统</span><span>”（http://gsas.yjs.suda.edu.cn</span></span><span>）</span><span><span>，在</span><span>“招生栏目”中选择“全国优秀大学生推免预报名”进行注册、预报名</span></span><span>（</span><span>报名截止时间以系统为准</span><span>）。</span><strong><span><span>特别提醒：</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>该系统是</span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>研究生院录取环节的</span><span>“苏州大学研究生报考服务系统”，</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span>不是</span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>教务处推荐环节的</span><span>“苏州大学本科生推免申请系统”</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span>，</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>请</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>不要混淆！</span></span></strong></p><p><span>考生</span><span>须</span><span>提前</span><span>准备以下材料：</span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>1）</span></span><span>我校</span><span>研究生报考服务系统</span><span>打印的推免申请表并本人签字</span><span>；</span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>2）本科期间成绩单（由所在学校教务部门提供并加盖公章），大学英语等级证书，各类获奖证书及其他证明自己学习研究等水平和能力的材料</span></span><span>。</span></p><p><span>2</span><span>．</span><span>“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”（以下简称“推免服务系统”，网址：https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm）</span><span>开通后</span><span><span>，所有推免生（包括前期已在我校</span><span>“苏州大学研究生报考服务系统”预报名的考生）务必登录教育部系统填写申请信息。</span></span></p><p><span>三</span><span>、</span><span>复试</span><span>与录取</span></p><p><span>1．</span><span>复试</span><span>考核</span><span>。</span><span>根据</span><span>材料</span><span>审核</span><span>择优</span><span>筛选</span><span>进入</span><span>复试</span><span>考核</span><span>名单。</span><strong><span>复试</span></strong><strong><span>为</span></strong><strong><span>线下进行</span></strong><strong><span>，</span></strong><strong><span>复试内容</span></strong><strong><span>为</span></strong><strong><span>综合面试</span></strong><strong><span>，</span></strong><strong><span>由外语能力测试、</span></strong><strong><span>综合素质考核、思想政治素质和品德考核等部分组成。</span></strong><strong><span>复试</span></strong><strong><span>时间</span></strong><strong><span>为</span></strong><strong><span>2</span></strong><strong><span>026</span></strong><strong><span>年</span></strong><strong><span>9</span></strong><strong><span><span>月</span><span>18</span></span></strong><strong><span>日</span></strong><strong><span>上午</span></strong><strong><span>8</span></strong><strong><span>:</span></strong><strong><span>3</span></strong><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>起</span></strong><strong><span>，</span></strong><strong><span>地点</span></strong><strong><span>为</span></strong><strong><span><span>苏州大学附属儿童医院总院（苏州工业园区钟南街</span><span>92号）门诊4楼儿科临床医学院</span></span></strong><strong><span>教室</span></strong><strong><span>。</span></strong></p><p><span>2</span><span>．</span><span>录取工作</span><span>。</span><span>综合考核</span><span><span>成绩以百分制计分，满分</span><span>100分，60分为合格。未参加复试、</span></span><span>综合</span><span>考核</span><span><span>成绩小于</span><span>60分</span></span><span>以及</span><span>思想政治素质和道德品质考核不合格的不予录取。</span></p><p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>．</span></span><span><span>教育部</span></span><span><span>“推免服务系统”开通后，获得推免资格</span></span><span><span>且复试</span></span><span><span>考核</span></span><span><span>通过的</span></span><span><span>考生进行网上报名并网上缴费（未缴费的考生视为放弃推免资格）</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>分别确认接收复试通知和待录取通知。考生在</span><span>“全国推免服务系统”可以接受多个复试通知，但只能接受一个待录取通知</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>确认录取后不得更改。</span></span></p><p><span>四</span><span>、</span><span>其他事项</span></p><p><span>1．</span><span>推荐免试生</span><span>占我</span><span>学院</span><span>202</span><span>7</span><span>年</span><span>的硕博招生计划。被我</span><span>学院</span><span>录取的推免生，如果在入学时未取得国家承认的本科毕业证书和学位证书，录取资格无效。</span></p><p><strong><span>2</span></strong><span><span>．</span></span><strong><span><span>所有推免生的资格审核确认、报考、录取均须通过教育部</span><span>“推免服务系统”进行</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>，</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>未通过</span><span>“推免服务系统”录取的考生一律无效。</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>．</span></span><span><span>其他</span></span><span><span>未尽事宜及相关要求见苏州大学研究生院网页</span></span><span><span>－</span></span><span><span>招生工作</span></span><span><span>－</span></span><span><span>招生动态栏。</span></span></p><p><span>五</span><span>、考生咨询及申诉渠道</span></p><p><span>1</span><span>．</span><span>联系部门：</span><span>苏州大学</span><span>苏州</span><span>医学院</span><span>儿科</span><span>临床</span><span>医学</span><span>院</span></p><p><span>2</span><span>．</span><span>联系电话：</span><span>0</span><span>512</span><span>-</span><span>80</span><span>6915</span><span>3</span><span>5</span><span>（</span><span>咨询</span><span>）</span><span><span>，</span><span>0</span></span><span>512</span><span>-8</span><span>069</span><span>3520</span><span>（</span><span>申诉</span><span>）</span></p><p><span>3．</span><span>电子邮箱：<span><span>sdeklc@163.com</span></span><span><span>（咨询）</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>sdfeyjwb@163.com</span></span><span><span><span>（</span><span>申诉</span><span>）</span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span>苏州大学苏州医学院儿科临床医学院</span></p><p><span>202</span><span>6</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>7</span><span>日</span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"cab532acde12e60e00ef0987fe99def3c5f7d41ccc7cc55b731d99c790d6d334","textLength":1150,"sourceSha256":"509d774bb996732148d451c371282e6049b7a5cf0168a60c2a3bddd4d6a3ace2","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-f002b7ac44728c37797b","title":"2026年苏州大学苏州医学院儿科临床医学院2027年接收推荐免试攻读研究生综合考核实施细则","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:51.134245+00:00"}
